pinned commit, plus the upstream MIT LICENSE. Upstream's standalone pin, sun-gear,
planet-gear and scratchpad sources and its STL exports are not vendored. The
fidget_spinner wrapper declares the same bearing and arm variables before including
fidget-spinner.scad, whose top level renders the assembled spinner.

